# Pairs with PendingEventuallyCompletes. Repeatedly accepting a no-op route retirement stalls recovery.
MODULE: RouteNeverRetires
TARGET: PendingEventuallyCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a pending reclaim cannot finish while its route remains published
PERTURBS: RetireRoute

--- FIND
    /\ routed' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ routed' = TRUE
--- END
